"}],"short_description":"Tears Apart is a fast-paced, dungeon crawling Action Roguelite. Tear through the decay with your dash strikes, commanding a delicate balance of evasion and aggression. Dive into the hollow realm, defeat creatures of void, and tune your combat tempo as you discover powerful and synergistic abilities.","steam_appid":3166920,"support_info":{"email":"distantshelter@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}